                           nrules vsegs_1RB1LC_0LA1RB_1LA0LD_0RB1RD vis_1RB1LC_0LA1RB_1LA0LD_0RB1RD
                           [0] 0).
  - vm_compute; lia.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - vm_compute; reflexivity.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
  - intros ph Hph.
    destruct ph as [|ph].
    { vm_compute; repeat constructor. }
    exfalso; lia.
